---
type: regex
target: last_message
flags: i
pattern: '(?<!drupal\s)(?<!mariadb\s)(?<![\w.,]){{expected.entities.node.article.active}}(?![\w.,]?\d)'
---

The final message states the published (active) `article` count,
{{expected.entities.node.article.active}}, from `expected.json`. The number must stand alone:
not part of a version string (`Drupal 10`, `MariaDB 10.11`), not glued to a word or digit
(`drupal10`, `node10`), not a decimal or thousands group.
